  "title": "Egg-Free, Dairy-Free, Nut-Free Cake",
  "description": "This egg-free cake recipe is made with chocolate chips, cocoa powder, oil, vinegar, and water for an easy one-bowl dessert that happens to be vegan.",
  "authors": [
    "Bridget Brooke"
  ],
